# Wire Fixtures for {{providerId}}

This folder holds recorded HTTP exchanges for replay conformance testing.

To record live exchanges against the upstream provider:

```bash
bun scripts/wire-proxy.mjs --upstream https://api.{{providerId}}.example/v1 --listen 127.0.0.1:8787 \
  --record src/__tests__/wire --secret-env {{providerUpper}}_API_KEY
```
